{"data":[{"id":1,"key":"industrial-automation","title":"工业自动化","slug":"industrial-automation","tagline":"以稳定运行为目标设计控制架构、机器人与产线集成。","overview":"Meridian 设计并调试将设备、安全与生产数据连接为可靠运营层的自动化系统。我们从工艺出发，先确定节拍、质量与可维护性，再选择硬件。","icon":"robot","image":{"id":3,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/automation.webp","alt":"工程工作台上的工业机械臂","caption":null,"credit":"Auledas","width":1200,"height":971,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/automation-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":388},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/automation-medium.webp","width":800,"height":647}]},"url":"/zh-cn/solutions/industrial-automation"},{"id":2,"key":"smart-manufacturing","title":"智能制造","slug":"smart-manufacturing","tagline":"在车间现场构建追溯、OEE 与质量智能。","overview":"我们把生产数据转化为运营决策。团队以反映工厂真实运行方式的数据模型连接设备、质量系统与人员，先单线验证价值，再规模复制。","icon":"pulse","image":{"id":2,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/manufacturing.webp","alt":"现代工厂中的汽车装配线","caption":null,"credit":"Marek Slusarczyk (Tupungato)","width":1200,"height":800,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/manufacturing-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":320},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/manufacturing-medium.webp","width":800,"height":533}]},"url":"/zh-cn/solutions/smart-manufacturing"},{"id":3,"key":"industrial-software","title":"工业软件","slug":"industrial-software","tagline":"把设备数据转化为决策的运营平台。","overview":"我们打造聚焦的运营软件，填补标准产品无法覆盖的空白：生产门户、质量流程、资产台账与集成层。每个界面都为真实班次设计，而不是为演示设计。","icon":"code","image":{"id":8,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/site-plan.webp","alt":"工程场地平面图","caption":null,"credit":"US Army Corps of Engineers","width":1200,"height":800,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/site-plan-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":320},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/site-plan-medium.webp","width":800,"height":533}]},"url":"/zh-cn/solutions/industrial-software"},{"id":4,"key":"infrastructure-engineering","title":"基础设施工程","slug":"infrastructure-engineering","tagline":"面向关键运营的可靠电气、公用工程与设施系统。","overview":"从负荷研究到调试，我们设计支撑生产与服务持续运行的物理系统。衡量标准是可靠性、可维护性，以及客户团队能独立运营的交付包。","icon":"grid","image":{"id":4,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/infrastructure.webp","alt":"堆叠集装箱上方的港口起重机","caption":null,"credit":"Guilhem Vellut","width":1200,"height":800,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/infrastructure-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":320},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/infrastructure-medium.webp","width":800,"height":533}]},"url":"/zh-cn/solutions/infrastructure-engineering"},{"id":5,"key":"digital-transformation","title":"数字化转型","slug":"digital-transformation","tagline":"从碎片化系统走向互联运营的务实路径。","overview":"以技术开头的转型往往失败。我们帮助管理层围绕明确的运营问题安排变革顺序，再交付让变革持续的数据、系统与习惯。","icon":"nodes","image":{"id":8,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/site-plan.webp","alt":"工程场地平面图","caption":null,"credit":"US Army Corps of Engineers","width":1200,"height":800,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/site-plan-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":320},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/site-plan-medium.webp","width":800,"height":533}]},"url":"/zh-cn/solutions/digital-transformation"},{"id":6,"key":"system-integration","title":"系统集成","slug":"system-integration","tagline":"一个团队跨供应商、协议与站点承担责任。","overview":"我们对接缝负责。Meridian 协调供应商、设计集成层、测试整体系统，并在不符合规格时继续负责。","icon":"link","image":{"id":7,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/precision.webp","alt":"五轴数控加工中心","caption":null,"credit":"Wikimedia Commons contributor","width":1200,"height":932,"focal_x":0.5,"fo